{
  "_comment": [
    "Vanilla's patch -- a cluster of tries fifteen blocks across -- at about four times the flowers'",
    "frequency, so a patch a writer asked for is one they meet. Each try is snapped back to the surface and",
    "kept only where the spot is open over solid ground, rather than jittered three blocks up and down as",
    "vanilla's are: a flower that lands in the air cannot survive and a block of gold can, and a colossal",
    "patch (`FeatureShape.withSpread`) crosses far more ground than three blocks can follow."
